    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="634b3119-b05a-5d58-b1da-da43d3563106" activityNameId="2271fecb-9edf-5ebb-9121-42c94ca13417" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kerosene, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kerosene, at regional storage
Inventory for the distribution of petroleum product to the final consumer (household, car, power plant, etc.) including all necessary transports. Considering the imports to Switzerland and share of biogenic fuels.;
UUID: 69ea4bf5-daf7-34d7-8f44-272d79749520
Transportation of product from the refinery to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and petrol stations. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents. Excluding emissions from car-washing at petrol stations.
Location: Surveys mainly for DE and CH.
Technology: Distribution of petroleum products.
Time period: Actual data for transport distances and NMVOC emissions. Some information for the year 2000. Split up of NMVOC emissions published 1989.
Production volume: 1715985t in 2016
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. 
Extrapolations: From single companies to average data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_69ea4bf5-daf7-34d7-8f44-272d79749520.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
